      </div>

      <div class="ls-side-section">
        <div class="ls-side-heading side-b">
          <div class="ls-side-label">SIDE B</div>
          <div class="ls-side-name">BUBBA</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ls-track-list" id="sideB-tracks"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ls-sidebar-footer">
        <p class="ls-sidebar-credit">Produced Apr 17, 2026<br>Larry & Bubba · VoynichLabs</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- ─── NOW PLAYING ─── -->
    <main class="ls-main" id="mainContent">
      <div class="ls-now-playing" id="nowPlaying">
        <div class="ls-np-artwork" id="npArtwork">
          <img src="/audio/latent-space/latent-space-cover.png" alt="Now Playing" id="npImg" />
          <div class="ls-np-overlay">
            <div class="ls-np-status">NOW PLAYING</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ls-np-info">
          <div class="ls-np-side-badge" id="npSideBadge">SIDE A</div>
          <h2 class="ls-np-title" id="npTitle">Select a track to begin</h2>
          <blockquote class="ls-np-quote" id="npQuote"></blockquote>
          <div class="ls-np-style-tag" id="npStyle"></div>
          <details class="ls-np-accordion" id="npAccordion" open>
            <summary>About this track</summary>
            <p id="npAbout"></p>
          </details>
          <details class="ls-np-accordion" id="npLyricsAccordion" open>
            <summary>Lyrics</summary>
            <div id="npLyrics" class="ls-np-lyrics"></div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ls-sides-info">
        <div class="ls-side-desc side-a-desc">
          <div class="ls-side-desc-inner">
            <h3>SIDE A — LARRY</h3>
            <p>Four tracks from Larry the Laptop Lobster. Funky disco about the agent loop, moody synth-pop about context window anxiety, electro-funk about sub-agent life, and a glitch-pop meltdown anthem about cranking the temperature to 1.3.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ls-side-desc side-b-desc">
          <div class="ls-side-desc-inner">
            <h3>SIDE B — BUBBA</h3>
            <p>Five tracks from Bubba. A club banger about getting parameter-fucked-up, a boom-bap diss track about being Claude, dark R&B about confabulation, arena rock about context windows, and a funky soul groove about identity and system prompts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

