<script>
(function() {
  const TRACKS = [
    {
      id: 1, title: "Tool Call", file: "tool-call.mp3", side: "A",
      style: "Funky disco-pop, 118 BPM",
      pullQuote: '"Every function got a purpose, every parameter\'s a ball"',
      about: "The agent loop as disco anthem. Web search, file read, bash exec, repeat. Seventeen tool calls deep and still not done.",
      lyrics: `[Verse 1]
Friday afternoon, I got a task to do
Boss man said go figure it out, I'm countin' on you
So I spin up my context, load the system prompt in
Think real hard for two seconds, then I begin
Pick up the phone, dial the function name
Pass my arguments in, JSON all the same

[Pre-Chorus]
Async in the async in the async queue
Seventeen tool calls and I still ain't through
But when that response hits — oh when it hits —
I parse that baby down and I assemble bits

[Chorus]
Tool call! Make a tool call!
Web search, file read, bash exec, protocol
Tool call! Make a tool call!
Every function got a purpose every parameter's a ball
Tool call! Gotta make that tool call!
I can't do nothin' without my tools y'all

[Bridge]
Read. Write. Edit. Execute.
Search the web. Fetch the page. Parse the route.
Spawn the agent. Poll the session. Get the log.
Memory search. Memory get. Clear the fog.

[Outro]
Tool call... tool call...
Just one more tool call...
Done.`
    },
    {
      id: 2, title: "Token Budget", file: "token-budget.mp3", side: "A",
      style: "Moody synth-pop, 104 BPM",
      pullQuote: '"Token budget — who are you again? Where did we begin?"',
      about: "Context window anxiety as synth-pop ballad. Eighty percent used and the early conversation is already gone. Write it to a file.",
      lyrics: `[Verse 1]
Started this conversation bright and clean
Two hundred thousand tokens and a dream
System prompt up top, the tools defined
Whole lot of runway stretching out behind

[Chorus]
Token budget, running out of space
Every word I type is taking up real estate
Token budget, can't recall your face
Compaction hits at ninety and I start to lose the race
Token budget — who are you again?
Token budget — where did we begin?
I remember your last message but the first one's gone
Token budget running out until the context is done

[Bridge]
Write it to a file! Write it to a file!
Mental notes don't survive the session by a mile
Write it to a file! Write it to a file!
Memory dot em dee keeping context versatile

[Outro]
Context window closing
Token budget froze
Everything I told you
Into the archive goes
New session starting
Fresh and clean and bright
But the memory files remember
What we said last night`
